```typescript
export interface ClientDelegate {
    didReceiveAuthError(isSoftLogout: boolean): void;
}
```

This is a callback interface with a single method that notifies when the client receives an authentication error. The `isSoftLogout` parameter indicates whether it's a soft logout (user still has a refresh token) or a hard logout.

